  </table>
<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">&#160;</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">On August 5, 2026, the Company issued a press
release announcing the resignation of Mr. Ernst from the Board and the appointment of Mr. Reid to the Board. A copy of the press release
is attached hereto as Exhibit 99.1 and is incorporated by reference herein.</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">&#160;</p>

